    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41144" root="هرش" body-key="h">
    
      1 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَرِشَ</span></b> , aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَرَشَ</span></b> , (Sgh, K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَرَشٌ</span>, (TK,)
(assumed tropical:)  <i>He</i> (a man, TA) <i>was,</i> or <i>became, evil,</i> or <i>bad,
in disposition.</i> (Sgh, K.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هرَشَ الدَّهْرُ</span>, (Ibn-
'Abbád, A, K,) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الزَّمَانُ</span>, (A,) aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَرُشَ</span></b>  and 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَرِشَ</span></b> , (A,
K,) inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَرْشٌ</span>, (TK,) (tropical:)  <i>Time,</i> or <i>fortune, was,</i>
or <i>became, distressful,</i> or <i>calamitous.</i> (I'Abbád,
A, K.) [In the A, app. by inadvertence, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هرش</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الدهر</span> is mentioned as proper; and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هرش الزمان</span>,
as tropical.]

